<% content_for :title, 'Explore your budget' %><section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">POSSIBILITY STARTS HERE</span><h1>What feels <em>comfortable?</em></h1><p>Start with your monthly budget. Get a little clarity on what might be within reach.</p></section><section class="section calculator-layout"><div class="calculator-card" data-controller="calculator"><%= form_with url: affordability_path, method: :get do |f| %><%= f.label :budget, 'I could comfortably set aside, each month' %><div class="budget-input"><span>₦</span><%= f.number_field :budget, value: @budget, min: 10000, max: 500000, step: 1000, data: { calculator_target: 'amount', action: 'input->calculator#number' } %></div><input type="range" min="10000" max="500000" step="1000" value="<%= @budget %>" aria-label="Monthly budget" data-calculator-target="range" data-action="input->calculator#range"><div class="range-labels"><span>₦10,000</span><span>₦500,000</span></div><%= f.label :term, 'Spread over' %><%= f.select :term, options_for_select([6,12,18,24].map { |n| ["#{n} months",n] }, @term) %><%= f.submit 'Explore my possibilities →', class: 'button primary full' %><% end %><p class="fine-print">No credit check. No commitment. This illustration assumes a 12% total financing charge over the selected term, not an APR or an actual lender offer.</p></div><div class="calculator-result"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE POSSIBILITY</span><h2>Care around<br><em><%= money(@range) %>.</em></h2><p>At <%= money(@budget) %> a month over <%= @term %> months, this is an illustrative treatment budget.</p><div class="note"><%= icon('wallet') %><p>Actual rates, fees, and approval are determined by a financing partner. We’ll help you understand the details before you decide.</p></div><a href="#possibilities" class="text-link">See care within this illustration ↓</a></div></section><section class="section muted-section" id="possibilities"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR STARTING POINT</span><h2>A few possibilities.</h2></div><span><%= pluralize(@procedures.count, 'procedure') %> to explore</span></div><div class="procedure-grid"><%= render partial: 'shared/procedure', collection: @procedures %></div><% if @procedures.empty? %><div class="empty-state"><h3>Let’s find another way forward.</h3><p>Try a different term, adjust your budget, or talk with Ora about your options.</p><%= link_to 'Talk to Ora', support_path, class: 'button outline' %></div><% end %></section>
